<title>BELARUS: SOCCER-BELARUSSIAN PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELARUSSIAN PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Tuesday of Belarussian</p>
<p>first round premier league soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Dnepr (Mogilyov)	    2     Naftan-Devon (Novopolotsk) 1</p>
<p> Torpedo (Minsk)	     0     Dynamo-93 (Minsk)	    3</p>
<p> Shakhtyor (Soligorsk)     0     Lokomotiv-96 (Vitebsk)     1</p>
<p> Molodechno		    0     Kommunalnik (Slonim)	 1</p>
<p> Dynamo (Brest)		2     Ataka (Minsk)		  2</p>
<p> Torpedo-Kadino (Mogilyov) 1     Dynamo (Minsk)		 4</p>
<p> Nyeman (Grodno)	     0     Belshina (Bobruisk)	  2</p>
<p> Transhmash (Mogilyov)     0     MPKTS (Mozyr)		  0</p>
